*   Task Processing Platform (TPP) framework
*   Task Database (TDB)
*   System Monitor (SM)
*   Task Processor (TP)
*   Worker Node class

The TPP framework provides APIs for registering worker nodes, storing tasks in the database, dispatching tasks to workers, and monitoring system performance.

