	}
	ns.Start()
}
```

This code sets up a basic Gin web framework with Redis and PostgreSQL for caching and message queuing. It also defines the `Notification` struct to represent individual notifications. The `NotificationService` struct represents the notification service itself, which will handle sending notifications based on their type and priority.']

